Subject: CVE-2026-118259 — FilterablePrometheusMetricReader for OpenTelemetry 1.67

OpenTelemetry Java 1.67 removed the PrometheusMetricReader constructor Solr 10.0.0 calls. Upstream Solr adopted a builder-based delegate in commit 095a03b43d012f3ecc7285bec1a526459e336035 so Gradle can pin OpenTelemetry to 1.67.0.

